---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Nishikino｜FIRST PROTOTYPE OF EDO CASTLE｜WORKS"
  description=""
>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <img
    src="/images/nishikino-edo-1.jpg"
    alt="初代試作江戸城"
    class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#f6f1e7]/85 via-[#f6f1e7]/45 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#8a7558]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          FIRST PROTOTYPE OF EDO CASTLE
        </p>

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[38px] leading-[1.15] text-[#30261f]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          初代試作江戸城
        </h1>

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#5a4a3b]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          The oldest surviving work, where it all began.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 flex items-center">
          <div class="h-[1px] w-[360px] bg-[#caa14d]"></div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- Introduction -->
<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />

  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Overview
      </h2>

      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        The First Prototype of Edo Castle is the oldest surviving work among my creations.<br>
        It began as a small castle Main Tower built as a survival base in Minecraft: Pocket Edition, and through repeated expansions, gradually developed into a Japanese-style castle corresponding in layout to the present-day East Gardens of the Imperial Palace.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          About the First Prototype of Edo Castle
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

        This was the starting point of my work and one of the earliest Japanese-style buildings I ever created. It remains the oldest surviving work in my collection.

        <br><br>

        It began during the era when the smartphone version of Minecraft was still known as “Minecraft: Pocket Edition.” I recreated an “Edo Castle made with Nanoblock” that I had seen online, using it as my survival base.

        <br><br>

        Before long, the castle Main Tower alone no longer felt sufficient, and the project continued to grow. I renovated the Main Tower and added turrets, moats, gates, and palace buildings, gradually expanding the scale of the castle.

        <br><br>

        Eventually, the entire site developed into a layout corresponding to the grounds of the present-day East Gardens of the Imperial Palace.

        <br><br>

        After completing the project, I moved the world from my smartphone to a PC. Fortunately, I had carefully preserved the world ever since, allowing the original appearance to survive to this day.

        <br><br>

        When I originally built the castle Main Tower, I remembered that I had not intended to create the entire castle grounds. For this article, I therefore went back through the world and carried out a fresh excavation and investigation.

        <br>

        As a result,<br>
        gates, moats, and the stone walls of turret platforms were discovered beneath the ground. The remains of the former castle Main Tower foundation also emerged, along with the outlines of the former Honmaru, Ninomaru, and Sannomaru areas arranged side by side.<br><br>

        The investigation revealed that the “First Prototype of Edo Castle” had gradually transformed through repeated expansions, eventually becoming a castle whose defensive structures corresponded to the layout of the present-day East Gardens of the Imperial Palace.

        <br><br>

        This project marked a turning point for me: I moved from simply “building my own castle as a survival base” to “recreating something that actually exists.” It remains the starting point of my approach to Japanese-style architecture today.

        <br><br>

        After this first stage, through which I learned the structure of Edo Castle, my next challenge became the recreation of an actual building as accurately as possible.

        <br><br>

        That challenge continued into the second stage, the “Second Prototype of Edo Castle,” which I created during my middle school years.

        </p>

      </div>

      <aside class="relative">

        <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]">

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Title</p>
              <p class="text-base">初代試作江戸城</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Category</p>
              <p class="text-base">Japanese-style Castle</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Construction Period</p>
              <p class="text-base">May – late July 2015</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Location</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                World preserved for architectural purposes<br>
                (Original prototype location: 1-1 Chiyoda, Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo 100-0001, Japan)
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Original Construction Period</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                (Original prototype: Keichō era – Kan'ei era)
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Builder</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                錦乃<br>
                (Original prototype: Tokugawa Shogunate)
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Type</p>
              <p class="text-base">Flatland Castle</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Software</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Minecraft: Pocket Edition 0.11.0<br>
                (Identified from notes written at the time)
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Work Type</p>
              <p class="text-base">Japanese Architecture・Prototype Recreation</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Status</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Completed<br>
                (Preserved in Minecraft Java Edition)
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

<!-- Gallery -->

<div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

  <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

    <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

    <p
      class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      GALLERY
    </p>

  </div>

  <h2
    class="mt-6 text-4xl"
    style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
  >
    Gallery
  </h2>

  <div class="gallery mt-12">

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/nishikino-edo-1.jpg"
        alt="初代試作江戸城"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/nishikino-edo-2.png"
        alt="初代試作江戸城"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/nishikino-edo-3.png"
        alt="初代試作江戸城発掘"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/nishikino-edo-4.png"
        alt="初代試作江戸城"
      />
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

    <div class="mt-24">

      <a
        href="/en/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← View Other Works
      </a>

      <a
        href="/en/first/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← The Beginning
      </a>

      <a
        href="/en/nishikinoedocastle2/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        Next →
      </a>

      <div class="mt-32 text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          Share This Work
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Copy URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>

<script>
  const sharePhrases = [
    "Found this.",
    "I kind of like this.",
    "Look at this.",
    "Found something interesting.",
    "Found something like this.",
    "Have you seen this?",
    "Found something.",
    "Came across this.",
    "Found something worth checking out."
  ];

  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)];

  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/en/nishikinoedocastle1/";

  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft First Prototype Edo Castle | WORKS`;

  const xShareButton = document.getElementById("x-share");
  const copyButton = document.getElementById("copy-url");
  const instagramButton = document.getElementById("instagram-share");

  if (xShareButton) {
    xShareButton.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );
  }

  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {
        copyButton.textContent = "Copied";

        setTimeout(() => {
          copyButton.textContent = "Copy URL";
        }, 2000);
      }
    } catch (error) {
      console.error(error);
    }
  });

  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog = document.createElement("div");

    dialog.innerHTML = `
      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >
        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            Share on Instagram
          </h3>

          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            Copy the URL of this work page<br>
            and open Instagram.
          </p>

          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            Copy URL & Open Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            Cancel
          </button>

        </div>
      </div>
    `;

    document.body.appendChild(dialog);

    const overlay = document.getElementById("instagram-share-overlay");
    const openButton = document.getElementById("instagram-open");
    const cancelButton = document.getElementById("instagram-cancel");

    openButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);
      } catch (error) {
        console.error(error);
      }

      window.open(
        "https://www.instagram.com/",
        "_blank",
        "noopener,noreferrer"
      );

      overlay?.remove();
    });

    cancelButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      overlay?.remove();
    });

    overlay?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      if (event.target === overlay) {
        overlay.remove();
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>

.work-hero{
  animation:heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  transform-origin:center;
}

@keyframes heroFloat{

0%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

50%{
transform:scale(1.06) translateY(-18px);
}

100%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

}


section{
position:relative;
}

section::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:0;
top:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
pointer-events:none;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 8% 10%,rgba(205,175,98,.08),transparent 18%),
radial-gradient(circle at 92% 82%,rgba(205,175,98,.06),transparent 22%);
}

aside{
position:sticky;
top:120px;
height:max-content;
}

a{
transition:.35s;
}

@media(max-width:1100px){

section{
overflow:hidden;
}

}


@media(max-width:768px){

section:first-child{
height:760px;
}

.work-hero{
animation:none;
}

}

.gallery-frame {
  position: relative;
  padding: 2px;
  border-radius: 1.25rem;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow: hidden;
}

.gallery-frame img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;

  border-radius: calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background: #f8f6f2;
}

.gallery-frame:hover {
  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
}

</style>

</Layout>